('advanced-native-1517', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1517-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["早餐供應時間配合這區居民的工作模式。"],"options":["句子主要談城市樂隊演奏的節拍。","攤檔時間與工人的作息完全不相配。","句子認定全城每人的作息都完全相同。","早餐供應時間配合這區居民的工作模式。"]},"advanced-native-1517-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The owner follows the hours when regular customers pass by.","Opening early makes the service useful to people on their way to work.","It fits the city’s rhythm in this area, where many people work early.","Workers need food before their early shifts."],"options":["The owner follows the hours when regular customers pass by.","Opening early makes the service useful to people on their way to work.","It fits the city’s rhythm in this area, where many people work early.","Workers need food before their early shifts."]},"advanced-native-1517-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The service fits the city’s rhythm in this district."],"options":["The service follows a musical beat played at the stall.","The service opens later despite customers needing breakfast earlier.","The service fits the city’s rhythm in this district."]},"advanced-native-1517-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["城市裏每個人都必須按完全相同速度生活。"],"options":["城市裏每個人都必須按完全相同速度生活。","可以用工時、交通與用餐時間說明生活步伐。","某種服務配合觀察到的作息。"]},"advanced-native-1517-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["To describe the city’s rhythm, look at actual routines and allow for different schedules."],"options":["To describe the city’s rhythm, look at actual routines and allow for different schedules.","Use one busy street at rush hour as the complete picture of every resident’s day.","Set the service hours first and assume residents will adjust to the pattern we prefer."]},"advanced-native-1517-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["A late book exchange could fit the city’s rhythm in this district. Our interviews show that many shift workers return home in the evening.","The city’s rhythm includes different schedules, so we could offer an evening book exchange as well as a daytime 