('advanced-native-1518', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1518-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["利用短休息時間買點三文治吃。"],"options":["先買三文治留待會後吃，現在不用餐。","句子已訂明只能花整整五分鐘吃完。","利用短休息時間買點三文治吃。","安排一頓長時間正式聚餐。"]},"advanced-native-1518-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["Something quick would fit the short break.","We could buy a light lunch on the way.","The café near the office has food we can get quickly.","Let us grab a sandwich at the café nearby."],"options":["Something quick would fit the short break.","We could buy a light lunch on the way.","The café near the office has food we can get quickly.","Let us grab a sandwich at the café nearby."]},"advanced-native-1518-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Let us grab a sandwich before the meeting."],"options":["Let us order sandwiches for delivery after the meeting.","Let us grab a sandwich before the meeting.","Let us book a long tasting menu that runs through the meeting."]},"advanced-native-1518-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["已精確保證買和吃合共只花五分鐘。"],"options":["以口語提議買或吃個簡便三文治。","已精確保證買和吃合共只花五分鐘。","在短休息時間安排方便午餐。"]},"advanced-native-1518-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Grab a sandwich suggests a quick meal, but we still need to check whether there is time to buy it."],"options":["Grab a sandwich suggests a quick meal, but we still need to check whether there is time to buy it.","Use the word quick as enough evidence and leave without checking the queue.","Assume that choosing a sandwich matters more than how long the café takes to serve it."]},"advanced-native-1518-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Let us grab a sandwich and eat in the park instead of having a long restaurant lunch. We can continue the walk afterwards.","We could grab a sandwich for a relaxed picnic during our walking tour."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1519', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1519-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["說話者認為湯值得再來，但尚未重訪。"],"options":["說話者覺得湯不合口味，不想再來。","說話者認為湯值得再來，但尚未重訪。","說話者已多次重訪，句子以此為必要條件。","說話者只覺得湯便宜，沒有表達是否值得重訪。"]},"advanced-native-1519-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["Yes, the soup is worth coming back for.","I would like another chance to enjoy that broth.","The food gave me a good reason for another visit.","I enjoyed it enough to plan another lunch here."],"options":["Yes, the soup is worth coming back for.","I would like another chance to enjoy that broth.","The food gave me a good reason for another visit.","I enjoyed it enough to plan another lunch here."]},"advanced-native-1519-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The exhibition is worth coming back for."],"options":["The exhibition is worth coming back for.","The exhibition mainly reminds me of visits I made before today.","The exhibition offers no reason for another visit."]},"advanced-native-1519-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["這表達只陳述已經重訪的事實，沒有評價值不值得。"],"options":["這表達只陳述已經重訪的事實，沒有評價值不值得。","可以先作值得再來的評價，之後才安排。","認為某事物足以成為重訪理由。"]},"advanced-native-1519-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Worth coming back for expresses a reason to return, so we can say it after a first visit."],"options":["Reserve the phrase for a completed return visit rather than a reason to plan another one.","Treat a plan to return as proof that the return visit has already happened.","Worth coming back for expresses a reason to return, so we can say it after a first visit."]},"advanced-native-1519-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["The practical advice at the community repair café is worth coming back for. I would like to ask the volunteers about another project next time.","The helpful explanations are worth coming back for when I have another repair question, even though I have only visited once."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1521', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1521-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["她們交流分開期間的近況。"],"options":["她們交流分開期間的近況。","她們在補做欠交功課，沒有聊生活。","她們正加快腳步追上前面的人。","她們只重複早已知道的家庭規則，沒有分享新消息。"]},"advanced-native-1521-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["It was a chance to hear how life had been for both of us.","We spent the evening catching up on each other’s news.","She told me about her new course, and I shared news from work.","We talked about what had changed since our last visit."],"options":["It was a chance to hear how life had been for both of us.","We spent the evening catching up on each other’s news.","She told me about her new course, and I shared news from work.","We talked about what had changed since our last visit."]},"advanced-native-1521-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["They are catching up over a meal."],"options":["They are catching up on overdue homework rather than talking about recent life.","They are rushing to catch a friend who is walking ahead.","They are catching up over a meal."]},"advanced-native-1521-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["學生補做漏交作業，沒有與人分享近況。"],"options":["學生補做漏交作業，沒有與人分享近況。","兩位親人談彼此上次見面後的經歷。","久未見面的朋友分享最近生活。"]},"advanced-native-1521-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Catching up can mean sharing recent news after time apart."],"options":["Use catch up only when one person is behind with a deadline.","Keep the talk to a familiar topic and leave recent changes out of the conversation.","Catching up can mean sharing recent news after time apart."]},"advanced-native-1521-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Before planning our next art project, we had a short call to catch up and share the new techniques we had learned.","Catching up helped the former partners understand how their interests had changed before choosing a new project."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1522', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1522-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["她聯絡弟弟，關心適應情況與需要。"],"options":["她要求弟弟交代每小時行蹤，句子以此為問候重點。","她聯絡弟弟，關心適應情況與需要。","她正在替弟弟辦酒店入住登記。","她只核對弟弟功課有沒有完成，沒有問近況。"]},"advanced-native-1522-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["I am checking in to see how he is settling in.","I want to know whether he needs any help.","It is a chance to let him know I am available to listen.","A short call can help us stay connected while he adjusts."],"options":["I am checking in to see how he is settling in.","I want to know whether he needs any help.","It is a chance to let him know I am available to listen.","A short call can help us stay connected while he adjusts."]},"advanced-native-1522-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["I am checking in to see how you are doing."],"options":["I am checking you into a hotel for the night.","I am asking for a full hourly report before offering any support.","I am checking in to see how you are doing."]},"advanced-native-1522-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["旅客在酒店櫃枱辦入住手續。"],"options":["旅客在酒店櫃枱辦入住手續。","打簡短電話問親人是否需要幫助。","發訊息問朋友新環境適應如何。"]},"advanced-native-1522-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Checking in can be a brief, respectful way to ask how someone is doing and offer support."],"options":["Focus on collecting times and locations before asking how the person feels.","Checking in can be a brief, respectful way to ask how someone is doing and offer support.","Make support depend on receiving a detailed report of the person’s whole day."]},"advanced-native-1522-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["I am checking in after the busy community event. How has the week been for you?","Just checking in to see how you are doing after the event. I am here if you want to talk."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1523', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1523-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["他們透過有聆聽的聯絡維持親近。"],"options":["他們只記錄通話次數，不在意對方說甚麼。","句子說定期通話已令親人不再有任何分歧。","他們透過有聆聽的聯絡維持親近。","他們主要調高房間溫度，沒有談關係。"]},"advanced-native-1523-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["They want to hear what matters in one another’s lives.","Sharing small updates helps them feel connected.","The calls give them time to listen and offer support.","They are keeping their relationships warm despite living far apart."],"options":["They want to hear what matters in one another’s lives.","Sharing small updates helps them feel connected.","The calls give them time to listen and offer support.","They are keeping their relationships warm despite living far apart."]},"advanced-native-1523-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["They are keeping their relationships warm."],"options":["They have left the friendship unattended until the next annual event.","They are keeping their relationships warm.","They are only increasing the number of messages without engaging with them."]},"advanced-native-1523-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["訊息數目增加便足夠，不需理會對方內容或感受。"],"options":["有聆聽的交流能維持情感親近。","訊息數目增加便足夠，不需理會對方內容或感受。","住得遠也能透過真誠交流維繫。"]},"advanced-native-1523-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Keeping their relationships warm takes meaningful contact, not only a higher message count."],"options":["Keeping their relationships warm takes meaningful contact, not only a higher message count.","Increase the scheduled messages before checking whether anyone feels heard.","Treat a regular notification as a substitute for responding to personal news."]},"advanced-native-1523-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["The club members are keeping their relationships warm through short walks between the larger gatherings. They make time to listen to one another.","Shared walks help the busy members keep their relationships warm, even when there is no large event."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1524', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1524-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["平凡而有關心的交流讓關係加深。"],"options":["quietly 表示家人不可交談才能親近。","句子只保證坐在同一桌便足夠，不需互動。","親人主要在比較誰講得最久，以決定關係親疏。","平凡而有關心的交流讓關係加深。"]},"advanced-native-1524-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["It is time to share worries before they become harder to discuss.","The familiar routine makes room for care and attention.","Family bonds are quietly strengthened when we listen to each other.","Small conversations give us a chance to notice one another’s needs."],"options":["It is time to share worries before they become harder to discuss.","The familiar routine makes room for care and attention.","Family bonds are quietly strengthened when we listen to each other.","Small conversations give us a chance to notice one another’s needs."]},"advanced-native-1524-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Family bonds are quietly strengthened through these conversations."],"options":["Family bonds are quietly strengthened through these conversations.","Family closeness comes from staying silent rather than sharing those concerns.","The main change is a longer meal, with no effect on how relatives understand each other."]},"advanced-native-1524-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["大家同桌卻持續忽視對方的話與需要，未見親近改變。"],"options":["平常互相幫忙，逐漸增加信任。","親人透過小對話理解彼此需要。","大家同桌卻持續忽視對方的話與需要，未見親近改變。"]},"advanced-native-1524-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Family bonds are quietly strengthened through caring interaction, so we should consider what happens during that time."],"options":["Extend the meal before asking whether relatives feel understood.","Family bonds are quietly strengthened through caring interaction, so we should consider what happens during that time.","Count attendance as enough evidence and leave out whether people listen to each other."]},"advanced-native-1524-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Family bonds are quietly strengthened when the children and their grandparents care for the balcony plant